WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
 

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.920
I was convicted of murder when I was a young girl.

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:07.720
I have been an inmate for 15 long years

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:11.820
If there has been a crime, people want a guilty person.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:15.450
Rightly or wrongly... does not matter.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.000
You've given up hope of being set free?

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:19.940
I saved my hopes for smaller matters

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.920
I live in hopes of having a better breakfast tomorrow than I had today.

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:30.140
I am a doctor. I work with the mind.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:35.480
It is not a question of your guilt or innocence that concerns me.

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:39.440
I simply wish to know what you yourself can actually remember.

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:41.960
I've lost part of my memory entirely.

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:45.860
My hope, sooner or later, we will bring back your memory.

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:48.360
I'm not at all sure I want it back

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:51.760
When I close my eyes

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:55.480
I can remember every detail of that house

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:59.600
The same sort of work from dawn to dusk

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:03.700
Always a mistress ordering me about.

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:05.380
- I'd like you to scrub this floor.

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:07.760
You stupid whore!

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:08.570
 

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:14.332
Strange to reflect that of all the people living in that house,

00:01:14.332 --> 00:01:17.389
I was the only one of them left alive in six months time.

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:22.926
Have you developed your own theories regarding her sanity?

00:01:22.926 --> 00:01:24.380
She could be a true amnesiac.

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:29.060
Or... simply guilty.

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:31.420
You are surrounded by dangers here.

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:35.020
Grace said she heard Death speak to her.

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:37.160
Let me in...

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:37.980
(Scream)

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:41.020
Let...

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:41.980
Me...

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:42.480
In.

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:43.640
(Scream)

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:47.320
They thought you could find answers.

00:01:49.180 --> 00:01:51.160
It is knowledge of me you crave, doctor.

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:55.460
Knowledge with a lurid glare to it.

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:59.100
Knowledge gained through a descent into the pit.

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:05.760
You want to go where I can never go.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.540
How can I be a murderer?

